<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Are there differences between the two cases that would undermine the similarity being relied on?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Are the shared features actually relevant to the conclusion, or only superficial?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is the conclusion really correct for the source case in the first place?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is there another similar case where a different conclusion was reached?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/cq/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/cq/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/cq/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is the conclusion modest enough for the strength of the comparison?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/cq/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy> .
