  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/map/ca2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Conclusion> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-analogy/map/ra> .
