<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "How likely is it that the cited consequences will actually follow if the action is taken?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "What evidence supports the claim that those consequences will occur?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Are there consequences of the opposite value, such as benefits of acting or costs of not acting, that should also be weighed?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is the question really a decision about what to do, or a question of fact on which good or bad consequences have no bearing?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences/cq/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences/cq/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences/cq/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is the speaker the one who would bring about the bad outcome, turning a warning into a threat?" .
