  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-consequences/map/o1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "A tested rollback plan makes a three-day outage unlikely, so the bad consequence is less probable than claimed." .
