<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "How credible is this person as an expert, judged by training, track record and standing in the field?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is the claim actually inside the person's field of expertise, or only next to it?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "What exactly did the expert say, and does it really imply the claim being made in their name?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is the expert personally reliable here, or do conflicts of interest or a history of bias give reason for doubt?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion/cq/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion/cq/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion/cq/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Do other qualified experts in the field agree, or is this a minority or disputed view?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion/cq/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/argument-from-expert-opinion> .
