  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/precising-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#Technique> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/precising-definition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Precising definition" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/precising-definition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "fixing the sense of a key term" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/precising-definition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "precising definitions" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/precising-definition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "sharpening a definition" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/precising-definition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/definition> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/precising-definition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A definition that starts from a term's existing, accepted meaning and narrows it with an explicit criterion for a given context (for example, \"lunchtime means noon to 1:30 p.m.\"), so that a vague or ambiguous word is used in one checkable sense throughout an argument, a rule or a dispute." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/precising-definition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/scheme/argumentation> .
