<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/insensitivity-to-sample-size#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/insensitivity-to-sample-size> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-09"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/insensitivity-to-sample-size> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CognitiveBias> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/insensitivity-to-sample-size> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Insensitivity to sample size" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/insensitivity-to-sample-size> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "neglect of sample size" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/insensitivity-to-sample-size> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "sample size neglect" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/insensitivity-to-sample-size> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "sample-size insensitivity" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/insensitivity-to-sample-size> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/cognitive-bias> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/insensitivity-to-sample-size> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The tendency to judge how likely a sample result is, or how much a sample proves, by how closely it resembles the population while ignoring how many cases it contains, so that small samples are trusted too much and their greater variability goes unnoticed." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/insensitivity-to-sample-size> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/scheme/cognitive-biases> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/insensitivity-to-sample-size> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Insensitivity to sample size" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/insensitivity-to-sample-size> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/base-rate-neglect> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/insensitivity-to-sample-size> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/insensitivity-to-sample-size> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/hasty-generalization> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/insensitivity-to-sample-size> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/heuristics-and-biases-program> .
