<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/logical-necessity-instructions#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/logical-necessity-instructions> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-06"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/logical-necessity-instructions> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#Technique> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/logical-necessity-instructions> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Logical necessity instructions" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/logical-necessity-instructions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "augmented logic instructions" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/logical-necessity-instructions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "instructional debiasing of belief bias" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/logical-necessity-instructions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "necessity instructions" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/logical-necessity-instructions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/debiasing> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/logical-necessity-instructions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A debiasing technique for deductive judgments in which the reasoner is told, or tells themselves, to assume the premises are true and to accept a conclusion only if it must follow from them, regardless of whether it is believable. It reduces belief bias in some studies but has not eliminated it." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/logical-necessity-instructions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/scheme/debiasing-and-metacognition> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/logical-necessity-instructions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Logical necessity instructions" .
