  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/analysis-of-competing-hypotheses> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A structured analytic technique, devised by the CIA analyst Richards Heuer, in which an analyst lays out every plausible explanation side by side in a matrix, scores each item of evidence against all of them, and favours the hypothesis with the least evidence against it rather than the most for it." .
