  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/misinformation-and-disinformation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "False or misleading information in circulation: misinformation is false content shared without intent to harm, while disinformation is false content deliberately created or spread to deceive or cause harm." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/misinformation-and-disinformation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/scheme/evidence-and-information-literacy> .
