  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/sift-method> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A four-step routine for checking online claims and sources quickly: Stop, Investigate the source, Find better coverage, and Trace claims, quotes and media to their original context. It replaces close inspection of a page with brief checks of what the rest of the web says about it." .
