<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/denying-a-conjunct#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/denying-a-conjunct/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/denying-a-conjunct/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Could both conjuncts be false at the same time?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/denying-a-conjunct/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/denying-a-conjunct> .
