  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/denying-a-conjunct/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is the speaker treating \"they can't both be true\" as if it meant \"it has to be one or the other\"?" .
