  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/denying-the-antecedent/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Does the speaker actually mean \"only if\", and if so, has that stronger claim been stated and defended?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/denying-the-antecedent/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/denying-the-antecedent> .
