  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/formal-fallacy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An argument that is deductively invalid because of its logical structure: it instantiates an invalid form, so any argument with the same form can have true premises and a false conclusion, whatever its subject matter." .
