  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/illicit-minor/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Does the conclusion make a claim about every member of its subject class?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/illicit-minor/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/illicit-minor> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/illicit-minor/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/illicit-minor/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In the premise where that subject term appears, is it only the predicate of an affirmative statement?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/illicit-minor/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/illicit-minor> .
