  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/illicit-minor/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Could some members of the conclusion's subject class lie outside the group the premises actually describe?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/illicit-minor/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/illicit-minor> .
