  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/masked-man-fallacy/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Does the conclusion swap a name or description inside \"believes\", \"knows\", \"wants\" or a similar verb?" .
