  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/masked-man-fallacy/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Does the person whose attitude is reported know that the two names refer to the same thing?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/masked-man-fallacy/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/masked-man-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/masked-man-fallacy/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/masked-man-fallacy/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Could the report be read as being about the thing itself (de re) rather than about how the person thinks of it?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/masked-man-fallacy/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/masked-man-fallacy> .
