  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/masked-man-fallacy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The invalid inference that swaps one name or description for another that picks out the same thing inside a belief, knowledge or other intensional context (\"a is b; someone believes Fa; so they believe Fb\"), or that concludes two things are distinct because someone thinks of them differently." .
