<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Does the \"must\" or \"cannot\" govern the whole if-then claim, or only the part after \"then\"?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Read with the modal over the whole conditional, does the conclusion still follow?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Read with the modal on the consequent alone, is that premise still true?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is the necessity in the conclusion logical, or only relative to the facts assumed in the premises?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/cq/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/c> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "It is impossible for this release to contain a regression." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/ca1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Conclusion> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/ra> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/ca1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Premise> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/o1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/ca1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#CA-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/ca2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Conclusion> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/ra> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/ca2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Premise> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/o2> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/ca2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#CA-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/o1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "What is impossible is passing every test that would catch a regression while still containing that regression; the 'cannot' governs the whole conditional." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/o1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/o2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "The valid conclusion is only that the release contains no regression the tests check for, not that it could not have contained one." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/o2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/p1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "If the release has passed every regression test, it cannot contain a regression." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/p1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy/map/p2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "The release has passed every regression test." .
