  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/modal-scope-fallacy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The invalid inference from \"necessarily, if P then Q\" and \"P\" to \"necessarily Q\", which moves a necessity operator from the whole conditional onto its consequent and so turns a conditional, relative necessity into an absolute one." .
