<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/quantifier-shift-fallacy#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/quantifier-shift-fallacy/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/quantifier-shift-fallacy/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Does the premise allow a different B for each A, or does it really say one B serves them all?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/quantifier-shift-fallacy/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/quantifier-shift-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/quantifier-shift-fallacy/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/quantifier-shift-fallacy/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Can you describe a case where every A has its own B but no single B works for every A?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/quantifier-shift-fallacy/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/quantifier-shift-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/quantifier-shift-fallacy/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/quantifier-shift-fallacy/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "If the conclusion needs one B for all, what separate evidence shows that such a B exists?" .
