<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/de-morgans-laws#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/de-morgans-laws> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/de-morgans-laws> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#Principle> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/de-morgans-laws> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "De Morgan's laws" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/de-morgans-laws> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "De Morgan duality" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/de-morgans-laws> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "De Morgan equivalences" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/de-morgans-laws> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "De Morgan rules" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/de-morgans-laws> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "De Morgan's rules" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/de-morgans-laws> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/propositional-logic> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/de-morgans-laws> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The pair of logical equivalences stating that denying a conjunction is the same as asserting that at least one conjunct is false, and denying a disjunction is the same as asserting that every disjunct is false: not-(P and Q) equals not-P or not-Q, and not-(P or Q) equals not-P and not-Q." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/de-morgans-laws> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/scheme/formal-logic> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/de-morgans-laws> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "De Morgan's laws" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/de-morgans-laws> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-a-disjunct> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/de-morgans-laws> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/conjunctive-syllogism> .
