  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/exists-forall-to-forall-exists-inference> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Exists-forall to forall-exists inference" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/exists-forall-to-forall-exists-inference> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "someone-to-everyone inference" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/exists-forall-to-forall-exists-inference> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "valid quantifier shift" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/exists-forall-to-forall-exists-inference> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "∃∀ to ∀∃ inference" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/exists-forall-to-forall-exists-inference> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/deductive-reasoning> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/exists-forall-to-forall-exists-inference> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The valid inference from \"some single y is related to every x\" to \"every x is related to some y\" (from ∃y∀x Rxy to ∀x∃y Rxy), which moves an existential quantifier inside a universal one and so trades a strong claim for a weaker one that it guarantees." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/exists-forall-to-forall-exists-inference> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/scheme/formal-logic> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/exists-forall-to-forall-exists-inference> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Exists-forall to forall-exists inference" .
