  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/method-of-counterexample> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A test for invalidity: to show that an argument form does not guarantee its conclusion, describe a case or substitution instance of the same form in which every premise is true and the conclusion is false." .
