  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/syllogism> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A deductive argument with two premises and a conclusion in which the premises share a linking element (in the categorical case, a middle term) that drops out of the conclusion; the family includes categorical, hypothetical and disjunctive syllogisms." .
