  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/cogency> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The property of a non-deductive argument that is inductively strong and whose premises are all actually true; in informal logic, more broadly, an argument whose premises are acceptable, relevant and sufficient for its conclusion." .
