<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/enthymeme#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/enthymeme> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/enthymeme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#Concept> .
