  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/enthymeme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "argument with a missing premise" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/enthymeme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "incomplete argument" .
