  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/enthymeme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An argument in which a premise, or sometimes the conclusion, is left unstated because the audience is expected to supply it; finding and fairly filling that gap is a core step in reconstructing and evaluating everyday arguments." .
