<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/necessary-and-sufficient-conditions#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/necessary-and-sufficient-conditions> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-09"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
