  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/representativeness-heuristic> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The mental shortcut of judging how probable it is that a case belongs to a category, or that a sample came from a process, by how closely it resembles the category's stereotype or the process's typical output, which neglects base rates, sample size and the reliability of the evidence." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/representativeness-heuristic> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/scheme/heuristics-and-dual-process> .
