  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/alfred-tarski> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Polish-American logician and mathematician (1901-1983) whose 1933 definition of truth for formal languages and 1936 model-theoretic definition of logical consequence gave modern logic its standard account of what it means for an argument to be valid." .
