  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/leopold-von-ranke> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "German historian (1795-1886) whose 1824 critique of earlier historians made the questions \"was this writer a firsthand witness, and is this account original or borrowed?\" the starting point of historical method, and whose Berlin seminar trained the first generation of professional, source-critical historians." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/leopold-von-ranke> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/scheme/history-and-thinkers> .
