  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/posterior-analytics> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Aristotle's two-book treatise (4th century BCE) on demonstration and scientific knowledge, which argues that a proof yields knowledge only when its premises are true, primary and explanatory, and that the chain of proof must end in first principles grasped without demonstration." .
