<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Which sentence in the argument can be parsed in more than one way, and what are the readings?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "On the reading that makes the premise true or authoritative, does the conclusion still follow?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is there evidence from context, the author's purpose or how the text has been applied before that settles which reading was intended?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Could the sentence be rewritten so that only one structure is possible, and does the argument survive the rewrite?" .
