  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly/map/o1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "The policy sentence can mean 'all meals, plus taxi fares over $25' or 'meals over $25 and taxi fares over $25'; the conclusion needs the second reading." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/amphiboly/map/o1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
