<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "If I set the conclusion aside, is there any reason left for believing the premises?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Would someone who doubts the conclusion already accept each premise, or only someone who agrees?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Does a key term or label in the premises quietly carry the conclusion inside it?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Traced step by step, does the chain of support loop back to the claim it is meant to prove?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/cq/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/cq/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/cq/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is this really an argument meant to persuade, or an explanation or definition where a loop is harmless?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/cq/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question> .
