  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/map/c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/map/ca1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Conclusion> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/map/ra> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/map/ca1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Premise> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/map/o1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/map/ca1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#CA-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/map/ca2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Conclusion> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/map/ra> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/map/ca2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Premise> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/map/o2> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/map/ca2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#CA-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/begging-the-question/map/o1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "The audit draws on the very logs whose accuracy is in dispute, so it cannot independently confirm them." .
