<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Which key term appears more than once, and can it be replaced by the same precise paraphrase every time it occurs?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Under the reading that makes the first premise true, is the second premise still true?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Does the conclusion follow only if two different senses of the term are treated as one?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is there a reasonable general reading of the term under which all the premises can be defended, so that the charge of equivocation would be unfair?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/cq/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/c> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "This candidate meets the analyst role's experience requirement." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/ca1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Conclusion> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/ra> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/ca1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Premise> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/o1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/ca1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#CA-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/ca2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Conclusion> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/ra> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/ca2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Premise> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/o2> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/ca2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#CA-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/o1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "In the job requirement, 'experience' means sustained hands-on work on real reports; in the second premise it means any exposure at all." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/o1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/o2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "Read with one sense throughout, either the second premise is false or the conclusion no longer follows." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/o2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/equivocation/map/p1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "The analyst role requires experience with the company's reporting database." .
