<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/hasty-generalization#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/hasty-generalization/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/hasty-generalization/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "How many cases is the conclusion based on, and is that enough for a claim this broad?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/hasty-generalization/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/hasty-generalization> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/hasty-generalization/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/hasty-generalization/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "How were the cases chosen, and could the way they were found make them unusual?" .
