  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/hasty-generalization/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Does the conclusion say \"all\" or \"always\" when the evidence supports only \"many\" or \"usually\"?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/hasty-generalization/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/hasty-generalization> .
