  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/hasty-generalization/cq/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/hasty-generalization> .
