<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "What exactly is the conclusion in dispute, stated in one sentence?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "What conclusion do the premises actually support, and is it the same claim?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "If the argument succeeds completely, does the disputed claim stand or fall, or is it untouched?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Does the argument contradict the opponent's thesis in the same respect, at the same time and about the same thing?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi/cq/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi/cq/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi/cq/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is there a definite alternative conclusion being argued for, or is the argument simply drifting away from the issue?" .
