  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ignoratio-elenchi> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The fallacy of offering an argument, often a perfectly good one, for a conclusion other than the one actually at issue, so that it misses the point it was meant to establish or refute." .
