<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Was the restriction (\"true\", \"real\", \"genuine\") part of the claim before the counterexample appeared, or was it added only after?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is there an independent, agreed criterion for membership in the group, or is membership now defined by having the property in question?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Could any possible case count against the revised claim, or has it become true by definition?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "If the narrowed claim is now safe, what does it still tell us about the actual members of the group?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/cq/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/cq/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/cq/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is the dispute really about how the term should be defined, and if so, has that been argued for openly?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/cq/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/c> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "So that colleague is not really an experienced engineer, and the original claim stands." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/ca1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Conclusion> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/ra> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/ca1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Premise> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/o1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/ca1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#CA-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/ca2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Conclusion> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/ra> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/ca2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Premise> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/o2> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/ca2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#CA-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/o1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "Experience was first measured by years on the team; it is now being measured by never skipping tests, which makes the claim true by definition." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/o1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/o2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "The counterexample should lead to revising the generalization (most experienced engineers run tests), not to reclassifying the colleague." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/o2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
