  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/p2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "A colleague with ten years on the team and pushed untested code last week." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/p2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/p3> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "A truly experienced engineer would never have done that." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/no-true-scotsman/map/p3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
