<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Apart from the order of events, what independent evidence links the earlier event to the later one?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Would the later event probably have happened anyway, for example through seasonal patterns, spontaneous recovery or a return from an unusual extreme?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Did anything else change at the same time that could explain the outcome?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "How often does the outcome occur when the supposed cause is absent?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc/cq/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/post-hoc-ergo-propter-hoc> .
