<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "What are the intermediate steps between the first move and the feared outcome, and is each one supported by evidence rather than just asserted?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Why would we lose the ability to stop partway, and could a clear rule or bright line be drawn to halt the slide?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "How likely is the final outcome, and is it really as bad as claimed?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is the argument just a warning about bad consequences dressed up as an unstoppable chain?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/cq/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/c> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "So we must not let the design team work from home on Fridays." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/ca1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Conclusion> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/ra> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/ca1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Premise> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/o1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/ca1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#CA-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/ca2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Conclusion> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/ra> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/ca2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Premise> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/o2> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/ca2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#CA-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/ca3> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Conclusion> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/ra> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/ca3> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Premise> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/o3> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/ca3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#CA-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/o1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "No evidence is offered that each step makes the next one likely; requests for Fridays at home do not force management to grant Mondays." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/o1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/o2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "Management keeps control at every step: a written policy capping remote days is a bright line that stops the slide." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/o2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/o3> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "The feared end state is assumed to be catastrophic without asking how other firms with hybrid schedules have fared." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/o3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/p1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "If we let the design team work from home on Fridays, the other teams will ask for the same." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/p1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/p2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "Once every team has Fridays at home, people will start asking for Mondays too, and soon nobody will come in at all." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/p2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/p3> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "An empty office would destroy our collaboration and culture." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/p3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/ra> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Conclusion> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/c> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/ra> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Premise> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/p1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/ra> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Premise> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/slippery-slope/map/p2> .
