  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/operational-definition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Defining a concept or variable by the concrete procedure used to observe or measure it (for example, \"customer churn means no login for 90 days\"), so that whether the concept applies in a given case can be checked by anyone who follows the procedure." .
