  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/problem-of-induction> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The philosophical problem, posed by David Hume, of justifying inferences from observed cases to unobserved ones: any argument that the future will resemble the past either cannot be deductive or must assume the very uniformity it is meant to prove." .
