<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/base-rate-neglect#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/base-rate-neglect/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/base-rate-neglect/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Before looking at this evidence, how common is the outcome in the relevant population?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/base-rate-neglect/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/base-rate-neglect> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/base-rate-neglect/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/base-rate-neglect/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "How often would this same evidence show up if the outcome were absent (the false-positive rate)?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/base-rate-neglect/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/base-rate-neglect> .
