  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/base-rate-neglect/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Out of 1,000 comparable cases, how many would show the evidence and actually have the outcome?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/base-rate-neglect/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/base-rate-neglect> .
