  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/calibration> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "calibration of confidence" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/calibration> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "forecast reliability" .
