  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/conjunction-fallacy/map/o1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "Every supplier-driven bankruptcy is also a bankruptcy, so 'bankrupt for any reason' must be at least as likely as 'supplier fails and vendor goes bankrupt'." .
