<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Are these events actually independent, or is there a real mechanism linking one outcome to the next?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "If I had walked in just now and not seen the streak, would my estimate for the next outcome be any different?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Am I expecting a short run to look like the long-run average?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is my judgment on this case being pulled by how I decided the last few cases rather than by its own merits?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/cq/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/c> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "The next shipment is now very likely to fail, so we should flag it before it is even inspected." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/ca1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Conclusion> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/ra> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/ca1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Premise> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/o1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/ca1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#CA-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/o1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "If each check is independent, the chance the next one fails is still about one in ten; seven passes do not create a debt that the next shipment must repay." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/o1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/p1> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "The quality team's random spot-check has passed the last seven shipments in a row." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/p1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/p2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "Inspections fail about one time in ten over the long run, and each shipment is checked independently." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/p2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/ra> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Conclusion> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/c> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/ra> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Premise> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/p1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/ra> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#Premise> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/p2> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/ra> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#partOf> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map/ra> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#RA-node> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#ArgumentNetwork> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy/map> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#illustrates> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy> .
