  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/gamblers-fallacy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#ProbabilisticFallacy> .
