<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is the figure being quoted the chance of the evidence if the person is innocent, or the chance the person is innocent given the evidence?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Before this evidence, how many people could plausibly have been responsible?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Out of everyone who could have produced this evidence by coincidence, how many would we expect to find?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy/cq/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "How much more likely is the evidence if the person is responsible than if they are not?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy/cq/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/prosecutors-fallacy> .
