  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/regression-to-the-mean> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#Phenomenon> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/regression-to-the-mean> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Regression to the mean" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/regression-to-the-mean> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "regression toward the mean" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/regression-to-the-mean> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "regression towards mediocrity" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/regression-to-the-mean> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "reversion to the mean" .
