<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/risk-communication#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/risk-communication> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
