  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/falsifiability> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Karl Popper's proposal that a claim or theory counts as scientific only if some possible observation could show it to be false; a theory that is compatible with every conceivable outcome tells us nothing testable about the world." .
