  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/occams-razor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The methodological principle that, other things being equal, you should prefer the explanation or theory that postulates fewer entities, causes or assumptions; it ranks rival hypotheses that fit the evidence equally well, and does not show that the simpler one is true." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/occams-razor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/scheme/scientific-reasoning> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/occams-razor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Occam's razor" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/occams-razor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/ad-hoc-hypothesis> .
