  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/selection-bias> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A systematic error that arises when the people or cases that end up in a study, sample or comparison differ from the population of interest because of how they were chosen, recruited or retained, so the observed association or estimate is distorted." .
